### =================================================================
### "馋了么" 后端API 全流程测试 (v3 - 含实时化验证)
### 
### 测试流程:
### 1. 依次注册并登录三个角色：商家、顾客、骑手。
### 2. 顾客浏览餐厅并下单。
###    >> 观察后端控制台，应有日志显示 'new_order' 事件被触发。
### 3. 商家获取新订单并确认接单。
###    >> 观察后端控制台，应有 'order_status_update' 和 'new_available_order' 事件日志。
### 4. 骑手查看订单广场并抢单。
###    >> 观察后端控制台，应有两条 'order_status_update' 事件日志（给顾客和商家）。
### =================================================================

# --- 全局变量定义 ---
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3001/api
@merchant_token = 
@customer_token = 
@rider_token = 
@new_order_id = 
@restaurant_id = 1
@menu_item_id_1 = 1
@menu_item_id_2 = 2

#################################################################
# 阶段 1: 认证 (Authentication)
#################################################################

### (1.1) 商家注册 (专用接口)
# @name merchantRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register/restaurant
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "user": {
        "username": "laoban_02",
        "password": "password_laoban_02",
        "email": "laoban02@test.com",
        "phone_number": "18800000012",
        "full_name": "老板二号",
        "user_type": "restaurant_admin"
    },
    "restaurant": {
        "restaurant_name": "老板二号的烧烤摊",
        "description": "滋滋冒油，香飘十里",
        "address": "虚拟美食街202号",
        "phone_number": "010-33334444",
        "opening_hours": "19:00-03:00"
    }
}

### (1.2) 商家登录
# @name merchantLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "laoban_01",
    "password": "password_laoban_01"
}

###
# 自动捕获商家登录后的token
@merchant_token = {{merchantLogin.response.body.token}}


### (1.3) 顾客注册 (通用接口)
# @name customerRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "xiaohong",
    "password": "password_xiaohong",
    "email": "xiaohong@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000013",
    "full_name": "肖红",
    "user_type": "customer"
}

### (1.4) 顾客登录
# @name customerLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "xiaohong",
    "password": "password_xiaohong"
}

###
# 自动捕获顾客登录后的token
@customer_token = {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}


### (1.5) 骑手注册 (通用接口)
# @name riderRegister
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "qishou_shandian",
    "password": "password_qishou_shandian",
    "email": "shandian@test.com",
    "phone_number": "18800000014",
    "full_name": "骑手闪电",
    "user_type": "courier"
}

### (1.6) 骑手登录
# @name riderLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "identifier": "qishou_shandian",
    "password": "password_qishou_shandian"
}

###
# 自动捕获骑手登录后的token
@rider_token = {{riderLogin.response.body.token}}


#################################################################
# 阶段 2 & 3: 核心业务流程与实时事件验证
#################################################################

### (2.1) [顾客] 浏览餐厅
# 无需token的公开接口
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants

### (2.2) [顾客] 查看餐厅详情 (ID=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/restaurants/{{restaurant_id}}

### (2.3) [顾客] 下单
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": 3,
    "deliveryAddress": "星天苑A座，请放前台",
    "items": [
        { "itemId": 5, "quantity": 1 },
        { "itemId": 6, "quantity": 1 }
    ],
    "notes": "加血，谢谢"
}

### (2.3) [顾客] 下单
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "restaurantId": {{restaurant_id}},
    "deliveryAddress": "未来科技城A座8楼，请放前台",
    "items": [
        { "itemId": {{menu_item_id_1}}, "quantity": 1 },
        { "itemId": {{menu_item_id_2}}, "quantity": 1 }
    ],
    "notes": "不要洋葱，谢谢"
}

###
# 自动捕获新订单ID
@new_order_id = {{createOrder.response.body.order.order_id}}

# ✅ **验证点 1**:
# 执行此请求后，立即查看后端服务的控制台（运行`npm run dev`的那个终端）。
# 你应该能看到类似下面的日志：
# [Socket] Emitting event 'new_order' to user [商家用户ID] ...


### (2.4) [商家] 查看新订单列表
# 验证新创建的订单是否出现在列表中
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/restaurant/new
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

### (2.5) [商家] 确认接单
# @name confirmOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{merchant_token}}

# ✅ **验证点 2**:
# 执行此请求后，查看后端控制台。
# 你应该能看到两条Socket事件日志：
# 1. [Socket] Emitting event 'order_status_update' to user [顾客用户ID] ...
# 2. [Socket] Broadcasting event 'new_available_order' to all clients


### (2.6) [骑手] 查看可接订单（订单广场）
# 验证刚刚商家确认的订单是否出现在这里
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/rider/available
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}


### (2.7) [骑手] 接单（抢单）
# @name acceptOrder
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}}

# ✅ **验证点 3**:
# 执行此请求后，查看后端控制台。
# 你应该能看到两条Socket事件日志：
# 1. [Socket] Emitting event 'order_status_update' to user [顾客用户ID] ...
# 2. [Socket] Emitting event 'order_status_update' to user [商家用户ID] ...


#################################################################
# 补充测试：异常与权限
#################################################################

### (3.1) [异常] 另一个骑手尝试抢同一个已被接的单
# 应该会失败，并返回 409 Conflict
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/orders/{{new_order_id}}/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{rider_token}} # 可以用同一个骑手或另一个骑手的token

### (3.2) [权限] 顾客尝试访问商家接口
# 应该会失败，并返回 403 Forbidden
GET {{baseUrl}}/orders/restaurant/new
Authorization: Bearer {{customer_token}}